+         remaining non-whitespace text.
+      2. ``message.reasoning`` / ``message.reasoning_content`` — direct
+         structured reasoning fields (DeepSeek, Moonshot, Novita, etc.).
+      3. ``message.reasoning_details`` — OpenRouter unified array format.
